# SearchScope Environment Configuration
# Default mode requires ZERO environment variables or paid API keys.
# All features operate autonomously using deterministic rule engines.

# Optional Future Extensions / External Integrations:
# ----------------------------------------------------
# Google PageSpeed Insights API key (Optional, free tier for lab & CrUX field data):
# PSI_API_KEY=

# Optional external proxy/scraper key for sites behind aggressive CAPTCHAs/WAFs:
# SCRAPER_API_KEY=

# Optional Browserless / Remote Chromium endpoint:
# BROWSERLESS_URL=
